<title>HUNGARY: PICK H1 '97 AFTER-TAX PROFIT HUF 1.079 BLN.</title>
<headline>PICK H1 '97 AFTER-TAX PROFIT HUF 1.079 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June</p>
<p>30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Jan-June 1997    Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating profit	 1,177.2     vs   1,047.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   1,190.1     vs     901.5</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	 1,079.3     vs     879.9</p>
<p>    Net sales		 14,343.9     vs  12,447.5</p>
<p>     Domestic sales	  8,886.0     vs   7,695.9</p>
<p>     Export sales	    5,457.9     vs   4,751.6</p>
<p>    Other revenue		228.8     vs     225.4</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales  10,994.4     vs   9,587.4</p>
<p>    Indirect cost of sales  2,013.9     vs   1,838.8</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	  280.4     vs     228.6</p>
<p>    Net financial income	 13.1 profit vs  163.9 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	  72.8     vs	13.4</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure    59.7     vs     177.3</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income    0.2 loss vs     18.1 profit</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue    14.6     vs	24.9</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expend.    14.8     vs	 6.7</p>
<p>    Taxation			120.0     vs	21.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Pick Szeged Rt is a meat processor. The figures are</p>
<p>not audited, are consolidated and were calculated in accordance</p>
<p>with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
